    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Galician (Spain) graphic artist and animator; BFA + MA (Illustrated Book and Animation) at Universidad de Vigo. Co-founded Rapapawn, an experimental frame-by-frame animation studio, with \u00d3scar Ra\u00f1a. Work bridges comics illustration and animation (psychedelic, surreal, frame-by-frame). Editorial clients incl. Alt Citizen, Editorial Elvira; Rapapawn won an ASME award (Best Digital Illustration, The Marshall Project, 2023). Featured on Booooooom and It is Nice That. Work Status Studio: she runs her own studio (Rapapawn) per its site and CV. Autonomy 4: self-directed studio principal delivering finished commissioned work, inferred. Capabilities locked to Illustration but she also does animation (see Open Question).",
